export interface ScopeRecord {
  readonly principal: string;
  readonly scopes: string[];
}

export function aggregateScopes(
  records: readonly ScopeRecord[],
): ReadonlyMap<string, readonly string[]>;
```

Group records by `principal`. Keys must appear in the order each principal first occurs, and each value must contain all scopes encountered for that principal in record and scope order. Preserve duplicates.

The function must not mutate `records`, any record, or any input `scopes` array. Every array stored in the returned map must be newly allocated: it must not be identical to any input `scopes` array, including when a principal occurs only once. Later mutation of an input scopes array must not affect the result.

